 "text": "Hi, how are you holding up? That's a really common issue. One way to fix it is to start with a small circle and build up from there. Start at the top of the page and connect the lines. It helps keep the eyes in the middle. Start with a small loop and then connect it to the eye. Or draw the top of the eye first, and then the loop. Enjoy the practice, and don't beat yourself up if they don't look great at first. Everyone starts somewhere.",
